                <note rend="inline" type="source">860p.512 Residence/8: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Latvia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Sussdorff</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-11-21T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 21,
                                1928—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>68. Your 94, November 21, 4 p.m. Telegraph whether tax in question is applied to
                    Latvian nationals as well as foreign nationals.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
